 "funds_verdict": "Funds below zero is impossible in the engine, not merely unseen: totalFunds changes only through spend and setFunds (src/micropolis.cpp:1066-1081); every charge is checked first (a tool is refused when totalFunds < cost, src/tool.cpp:154; the yearly budget pays at most taxFund + totalFunds and otherwise pays nothing and switches auto-budget off, src/budget.cpp:124-230, 268-310); setFunds is otherwise called only at load or reset with a fixed positive amount. The one caveat is arithmetic: spend and setFunds take a 32-bit int, so the bound holds while funds stay below 2,147,483,647."
